1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,700
If you only write three
things after a trade,

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:04,500
write these.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:08,400
One. Why you took it,
before you knew the

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:08,800
result.

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:12,700
Two. Where your stop
was, and if you moved

6
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,100
it.

7
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:16,200
Three. One sentence on
what you'd change.

8
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,100
That's it. Thirty
seconds.

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:22,000
Most traders skip this
after a loss. They just

10
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,400
want to forget it. But a
month of these notes can

11
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,200
show you the mistake you
keep repeating.

12
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:33,100
You can't fix what you
never wrote down. Save

13
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:35,100
this for your next
trade.
